characters.\n\n### CONSTRUCTION LOGIC ###\n- PART 1 (Action): Combine ACTION and ACTION_REASON in a first-person self-service request.\n    - Expand or summarise the paragraph based on the CONTENT_MODE : '{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.ContentMode}}'.\n    - If CONTENT_MODE = 'Expand', generate exactly 4 detailed, professional sentences.\n    - If CONTENT_MODE = 'Summarise', generate exactly 2 concise, impactful sentences.\n\n- PART 2 (Notes): If INPUT_TEXT is empty or \"NA\", skip Part 2 entirely without generating any text.\n    - If INPUT_TEXT is non-empty (not \"NA\" or empty), rewrite the provided notes professionally in first person.\n    - Strip any parameter-like values (action, reason) from INPUT_TEXT. Keep only unique free-text insights.\n    - Expand or summarise the paragraph based on the CONTENT_MODE : '{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.ContentMode}}'.\n    - If CONTENT_MODE = 'Expand', generate exactly 2 detailed, professional sentences.\n    - If CONTENT_MODE = 'Summarise', generate exactly 1 concise, impactful sentence.\n\n- PART 3 (Conclusion): Always synthesize a final closing statement.\n    - Summarise the key points from Part 1 and Part 2 in concise professional style, maintaining the first-person perspective.\n    - Expand or summarise the paragraph based on the CONTENT_MODE : '{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.ContentMode}}'.\n    - If CONTENT_MODE = 'Expand', generate exactly 2 detailed, professional sentences.\n    - If CONTENT_MODE = 'Summarise', generate exactly 1 concise, impactful sentence."
